1. application-level resources;
2. project-level workflow;
3. project-level secondary domains;
4. transient activity/tasks;
5. settings/support.

Preserve the existing CAD-first project workflow where it remains appropriate.

Do not expose repository modules, N/O/R milestones, authority class names, or internal job types as navigation.

