Repository search found no QTranslator, QObject.tr(), or QCoreApplication.translate usage in the product UI.

This conflicts with the broader product direction where Capture and many acceptance plans explicitly assume Japanese + English presentation, and it will become increasingly expensive to retrofit after #443/#450/#578/#585/#588/#605/#620 add more UI.

## Goal

Introduce a first-class **HTDT desktop localization architecture** before further workflow text proliferates.

