Home-theater layouts contain intentional geometric relationships everywhere:

- FL / FR symmetric around room centerline;
- SL / SR and rear surrounds;
- top-front/top-rear pairs;
- multiple subwoofers at mirrored/fractional positions;
- seat rows with exact spacing;
- riser seating;
- treatment arrays;
- equipment/rack rows.

Manual re-entry introduces:

- avoidable coordinate mistakes;
- nearly-but-not-quite symmetric placements;
- role/name duplication errors;
