SceneEntityClipboard
- source document/project ref
- entity snapshots[]
- local group pivot
- semantic dependencies
- clipboard schema/version
```

Paste:

- allocates new entity IDs;
- preserves reusable EquipmentDefinition references where exact;
- never copies immutable observation/measurement identity as if it were a new observation;
- applies a visible offset or placement target so pasted geometry is discoverable.

Cross-project paste is allowed only for portable semantic entity content whose dependencies resolve exactly.

