## Operation model

Conceptually:

```
ApplicationOperation
- operation_id
- operation_kind
- project/document ref
- input authority refs
- display title
- started_at
- state
- progress model
- cancellability
- retryability
- result/error summary
- originating deep link
- invalidation/currentness state
```

Possible states:
- queued;
- preflighting;
- running;
- cancellation_requested;
- cancelled;
- completed;
- failed;
- result_stale / completed_for_historical_input.

Do not confuse execution state with domain result authority.

