Individual features correctly bind exact upstream authority, but the causal dependency chain is fragmented across modules.

This is different from #443 Overview readiness. #443 tells the user current blockers/actions; this issue explains **causal invalidation and the minimal revalidation path after a change**.

## Ordinary examples

