- placement / room-use constraints not already represented as geometry;
- optional acoustic/noise goals;
- explicit required / preferred / informational classification;
- provenance/source and user-authored rationale.

Do **not** collapse these into one global score. The brief should aggregate references and explicit priorities while preserving each criterion's independent semantics and UNKNOWN state.

