## Current implementation

The Room object palette creates one seat at a time.

Source:
https://github.com/bolph71656-ai/Home-Theater-Digital-Twin/blob/79262f50777f61e79d12a3be2afdbbb2d5a2680d/backend/src/htdt/room_workspace.py

Each seat is a normal SceneEntity and later authorities can independently bind:

- listener/ear reference;
- eye point;
- head/obstruction geometry;
