- head-center offset;
- head radius.

These are semantic references, not inferred from generic box center.

Coordinate with #472.

### 6. Stable individual identity

Each materialized seat gets a stable unique SceneEntity ID.

Downstream systems must continue to address seats individually:

- prediction;
- measurement targets;
- campaign cells;
