Use a cyclic colormap/legend and explicit wrap convention.

Do not display phase when only magnitude authority exists.

## Interpolation semantics

A displayed slice may require interpolation from FEM mesh, voxel/FDTD grid or sparse provider output.

The UI must distinguish:

- exact sampled node/cell values;
- interpolated display values.

Interpolation is a visualization operation unless the provider/result contract explicitly makes it part of the numerical result.

